    reader — build it so 043 extends rather than duplicates. The sprk_enddate read-side asymmetry found while
    scoping this task is recorded for 043, not fixed here.
  </notes>

  <execution><skill>.claude/skills/task-execute/SKILL.md</skill></execution>
</task>
